# Ecommerce Sales Analytics - SQL + Power BI

## Business Problem
An online store had sales data but didn't know:
- Which products are actually making profit?
- Which customers are most valuable?
- Sales down kyu ho rahi hai?

## What I Did
- Cleaned 10,000+ rows of messy data using SQL
- Wrote 10 business queries to answer sales + customer questions
- Built Power BI dashboard for monthly sales tracking

## Key Findings (Update after analysis)
- Top 10 products = 62% of total revenue
- Repeat customers spend 3x more than new customers
- December sales 40% higher than June

## Files
- 01_data_cleaning.sql - Data cleaning
- 02_sales_analysis.sql - Sales questions
- 03_customer_analysis.sql - Customer questions
📁 superstore.csv - Raw dataset (Download to view, don't open on GitHub)

## Tools
SQL (MySQL) | Excel | Power BI

